    "description": "The main function\r\n1. Animal test to see the animals most like you.\r\n2. Cartoon video, try a different cartoon style.\r\n3. Get old and young, go back to childhood or see how you will look in the future with one click.\r\n4. Animate face, make your own photos come alive.\r\n5. One-click face change, enjoy the fun of face change.\r\n6. GIF generator: both photos and videos can be turned into GIF animations.\r\n\r\nCartoon video\r\nWe provide different styles of cartoon video effects, come and see which ones are suitable for you!\r\n\r\nTime Magic\r\nWith a single click, you can predict what you will look like in decades.\r\nIt can also take you back to the past and see your young self in the camera.\r\n\r\nAnimate face\r\nOne - click to give life to photos.\r\n\r\nOne - key face change\r\nSmart face change to play various roles with one click, highlight individuality, and let yourself go.\r\n\r\nGIF Makers\r\nSupports converting videos and pictures into GIF, and you can quickly create GIF animations with your fingers.",
